00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:29.320
Goal asks, is there a way
to access Khan Academy Kids

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:30.780
through a browser?

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:32.910
I have two kids but only one mobile device

00:19:32.910 --> 00:19:34.003
for them to use.

